# Build artifacts and dependency trees never belong in the build context.
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
.git
.gitignore

# NOTE: docs/, apps/ and packaging/ must stay in the context even though most of
# their content is not shipped. The host reads three files at compile time
# through include_str! — the l10n JSON (apps/ios/Kit/.../Resources/Languages),
# the crypto test vectors (docs/reference/fixtures) and the update signing key
# (packaging/updates). Excluding those directories breaks `cargo build`.
